docs_I30.bin, docs_root.bin and docs_fls.txt come from an NTFS volume
written for these tests on Linux: mkntfs (ntfs-3g), a folder `docs` filled
with report_001.txt to report_300.txt, then report_050..069 and
report_200..219 deleted, then unmounted. docs_I30.bin is the folder's
$INDEX_ALLOCATION:$I30 and docs_root.bin its $INDEX_ROOT:$I30 (The Sleuth
Kit: icat slack.img 64-160-5 and 64-144-2); docs_fls.txt is The Sleuth
Kit's listing of the folder (fls slack.img 64). Under this crate's
licences.
